{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"As the wrappings fall to the ground, the form of the gunsmith begins to be revealed. At first their hand and fingers begin to look as though they are made of shadow, but it soon becomes clear that it is actually a substance much like the one in the vial the shard is suspended. Underlying in the the translucent starry-sky like substance is a network of wood, much like a nervous system and skeleton in one.","created_at":"2021-08-24T01:51:51.211000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879543498670489650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
