{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"Bo smiles. \"I have grown to like the feeling of helping others, and so i have come looking... To offer you my aid. Your task is one of the greatest i have ever read about.\" Bo sets his banjo down, and yet it doesnt touch the ground. It levitates beside him, growing darker.","created_at":"2021-08-28T06:09:19.799000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881057846207336489","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
