{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"Bo bows graciously. \"Let me take the job, let me ferry the souls.\" He smiles as the darkened banjo has taken shape beside him, mimicking his bow in every detail.","created_at":"2021-08-28T06:24:00.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881061540114104320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
