{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"Bo nods and smiles as the stability of his own body begins to fade, the shadowy form beside him dispersing in the wind. He looks his hands over as he has now become ethereal. He looks back to his carpet, which has taken on the same aspects. \"You mind if i ferry on him?\" He laughs with glee.","created_at":"2021-08-28T06:32:02.047000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881063559889575998","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
