{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850806376740945952","content":"Bo smiles and tail brushes his cheek from the left, he quickly turns to look, and see's nothing. He turns to the right as he hears a child like Giggle. Lucy smiles from his shoulder. \"I aint lettin you do this by yourself ya know.\" She remarks as she nuzzles his cheek. \n\n\"As far as payment from the souls, does it have to be Drachma?\" Bo asks as he pets Lucy.","created_at":"2021-08-28T06:37:16.839000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"881064880222900244","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
